# SSL Certificates Directory

This directory should contain SSL certificates for HTTPS support.

For development/testing, you can generate self-signed certificates:

```bash
openssl req -x509 -nodes -days 365 -newkey rsa:2048 \
  -keyout nginx/certs/privkey.pem \
  -out nginx/certs/fullchain.pem \
  -subj "/CN=localhost"
```

**Note:** These certificates are automatically generated in CI and should not be committed to the repository.
